      "source_provenance": "Paper sections 3.1–3.5, Figs. 3,4,6,8,9,10 and associated numerical descriptions.",
      "generation_method": "Direct transcription of the paper's reported numerical values and qualitative trends; tolerances include the paper's own error bars and additional spread expected from a different DFT code.",
