        "criterion_3": "bond‑angle: Ni‑Ni‑Ni and Ni‑Ni‑Nb peaks near 55° and 110° sharpen, shift ~2° at 1233 K.",
        "criterion_4": "CSRO: Ni‑Ni >0, Nb‑Nb >0, Ni‑Nb <0, Nb‑Ni <0, magnitudes 0.08–0.4.",
